1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,130
Your content is everywhere.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:06,660
Inboxes, drives, old servers, someone's laptop.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,270
Four moves change that.

4
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:11,840
The problem:

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,780
the same file lives in seven places.

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,720
Move one: bring it all in.

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,480
Drop in files, and whole folders.

8
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,260
Send a link,

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,610
and clients upload without an account.

10
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,390
Capture email from Gmail,

11
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:27,710
and unpack old PST archives.

12
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:30,470
Move Exchange, Google Drive and SFTP in,

13
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,410
mapped to their owners.

14
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,300
Now there's one place, and one set of rules.

15
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,870
The problem: finding the right version,

16
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,640
and sharing it safely.

17
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,690
Move two: find it, share it, finish it.

18
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:45,990
Search across files,

19
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:48,300
scans and email, in seconds.

20
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:50,170
Preview without downloading,

21
00:00:50,210 --> 00:00:52,840
mark it up, and redact what's private.

22
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:55,580
Share inside and out, with links that expire,

23
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,420
and downloads switched off.

24
00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:00,110
Comment, tag, and send for signature,

25
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:01,830
without leaving the page.

26
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:04,030
No more “can you resend it?”

27
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:05,540
The problem:

28
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:08,350
rules that live in spreadsheets, and memory.

29
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:12,250
Move three: let it run by the rules.

30
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:14,470
Workflows route review,

31
00:01:14,510 --> 00:01:16,950
approval and signature, on their own.

32
00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:20,020
Retention keeps every record on schedule,

33
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:22,340
and deletes only with approval.

34
00:01:22,450 --> 00:01:25,060
Legal hold freezes what a case needs.

35
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:28,290
Labels, roles and single sign-on decide who can see,

36
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:30,090
share, or delete.

37
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:32,410
And every action is on the record,

38
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:34,030
ready to export.

39
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:37,530
The problem: content that just sits there.

40
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:40,820
Move four: put it to work.

41
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:44,210
Document AI reads scans and fills in the fields,

42
00:01:44,250 --> 00:01:45,710
tables included.

43
00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:47,560
Search by what's inside.

44
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:49,830
Or ask a folder, and get an answer,

45
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:51,260
with its sources.

46
00:01:53,050 --> 00:01:54,180
Bring it in.

47
00:01:54,450 --> 00:01:55,480
Find it.

48
00:01:55,750 --> 00:01:56,830
Govern it.

49
00:01:57,050 --> 00:01:58,280
Put it to work.

50
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:00,710
Solix ECS.

51
00:02:00,850 --> 00:02:02,200
Keep the proof.
